export anchor CorkboardStyle:
    number: 113
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Corkboard
    idea: The dashboard is a framed corkboard where index cards, sticky notes and paper slips are held up with push pins, and the project cards hang from a sagging red yarn strung pin to pin.
    base: light
    palette:
        wall: #efe9df, around the board and behind the header
        cork: #d9b98a, the board, speckled with #b8935e, #c9a571 and #e8cfa6
        frameWood: #a87d4c, the 16px board frame
        indexCard: #fffdf6, cards, slips, fields and the sheet
        ruledBlue: #a9c4e0, card lines, decoration only
        marginRed: #e08a86, the card header line, decoration only
        stickyYellow: #fff1a8, the overdue note, the avatar and the current nav tab
        maskingTape: #efe3c2, section labels
        redYarn: #b3262e, the string between pins and this week bars
        ink: #2b2118, text and marker lines
        blueBiro: #1d5fa8, progress hatching and the focus ring
        redPen: #a8201a, the primary button, overdue and Behind
        greenPen: #236b3a, On track
        amberPen: #8a4f00, At risk
    type:
        Three stacks. Headings and numbers use Marker Felt, Chalkboard SE,
        Comic Sans MS, Comic Neue, Trebuchet MS in bold. Card text uses
        American Typewriter, Courier Prime, Courier New, Courier. Controls
        use system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial. The greeting is 38px marker
        at 1.15, card numbers 50px, card titles 21px on 26px, section labels
        20px, card text 14 to 15px on a 24px ruling.
    layout:
        A wall header holds a small corkboard logo, a card coloured search,
        a red New project button with a hard ink drop, a bell and a yellow
        MO circle. The board has a 16px wood frame with an inset shadow.
        Along its top, six white paper nav tabs each hang from a coloured
        pin, the current one yellow and tilted with a red marker underline.
        The first row pairs a pinned card with a red top edge holding Hi
        Mara, the date and a line about the board, plus a taped yellow
        sticky note in red marker with a burst saying 4 tasks are overdue,
        with four small pinned cards for the numbers, tilted alternately.
        A masking tape label marks Projects, then six ruled index cards three
        across, each pinned and tilted, joined pin to pin by a sagging red
        yarn, with the marker name, typed Team, Tasks and Due rows, a marker
        drawn bar hatched in blue to the percent, the percent and status. The
        last row has a graph paper card pinned twice with hatched last week
        bars and red this week bars, and Latest notes as six pinned paper
        slips tilted left and right. Below 1040px cards go two across, below
        640px one, and the yarn drops straight down behind the cards.
    spacing: An 8px unit with 24px card ruling. 40px gaps between cards leave room for pins and yarn.
    density: Medium. Cards three across, slips stacked in a column.
    corners: Square paper. Controls 6px, marker bars slightly uneven.
    borders: A 16px wooden frame around the cork, 1.5 to 2px ink lines on controls and marker bars.
    shadows: Soft drops under every paper, a hard pin shadow and an inset shadow inside the frame.
    icons:
        Solid filled shapes with white marks at 18px. A ticked circle for On
        track, a triangle for At risk, a crossed square for Behind and a
        burst for overdue, with the typed word. Push pins in red, blue, green
        and yellow are decoration.
    focus: A 3px blue outline offset 3px inside a 6px card coloured halo.
    tone: Office board notes, such as Pinned up for the team and Latest notes.
